cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Playhead in your work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Playhead: overview curves and analysis-driven tools for music and game audio"
abstract: >-
  Playhead draws a waveform plus one or two feature lines (intensity, activity,
  tension, beats, sections, event types) so the content of a music or sound
  effect asset can be read at a glance, and uses the same analysis to drive
  editing, mixing and mastering tools. It runs entirely in the browser.
authors:
  - family-names: Sandner
    given-names: Daniel
version: 0.1.0
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/eigensoundlab/playhead"
url: "https://eigensoundlab.github.io/playhead/"
keywords:
  - audio visualization
  - waveform
  - psychoacoustics
  - music information retrieval
  - game audio
  - sound design
  - adaptive audio effects
  - Web Audio
